        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e8" value="⑧ HTTP" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#2D7600;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" target="nodeport">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ===================== FLUXO ===================== -->
        <mxCell id="fluxo" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Fluxo de funcionamento&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;①&lt;/b&gt; O desenvolvedor executa &lt;i&gt;kubectl apply -f pod.yml / service.yml&lt;/i&gt;; o kubectl envia o manifesto ao &lt;b&gt;kube-apiserver&lt;/b&gt;.   &lt;b&gt;②&lt;/b&gt; O apiserver valida o objeto e grava o estado desejado no &lt;b&gt;etcd&lt;/b&gt;.   &lt;b&gt;③&lt;/b&gt; O &lt;b&gt;kube-scheduler&lt;/b&gt; detecta o Pod sem nó e escolhe o Node mais adequado (CPU, memória, afinidade).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;④&lt;/b&gt; O &lt;b&gt;kube-controller-manager&lt;/b&gt; reconcilia continuamente estado atual × desejado (réplicas, Endpoints do Service).   &lt;b&gt;⑤&lt;/b&gt; O &lt;b&gt;kubelet&lt;/b&gt; do nó recebe a especificação do Pod e aciona o runtime via CRI, reportando o status de volta.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⑥&lt;/b&gt; O &lt;b&gt;Container Runtime&lt;/b&gt; baixa a imagem &lt;i&gt;egondimjr/meu_app_python:1.0&lt;/i&gt; do Docker Hub e inicia o contêiner dentro do Pod.   &lt;b&gt;⑦&lt;/b&gt; O &lt;b&gt;kube-proxy&lt;/b&gt; cria as regras de rede do Service (ClusterIP :80 e NodePort :30080).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⑧&lt;/b&gt; O usuário acessa &lt;i&gt;http://&amp;lt;minikube-ip&amp;gt;:30080&lt;/i&gt; → NodePort → &lt;b&gt;Service&lt;/b&gt; → Pod (label &lt;i&gt;app=meu-app-python&lt;/i&gt;) → contêiner Flask na porta 5000." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#326CE5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1005" width="1750" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
